eypot\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-moneystuff-英伟达市值蒸发4000亿美元-只因ceo一段绯闻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">40:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達市值蒸發4000億美元，只因CEO一段緋聞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳曾公開嘲諷對華芯片擔憂是「loser mentality」，如今他自己被曝與涉華人士有染，這段緋聞直接導致英偉達市值一夜蒸發約4000億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Behind the Scenes Minis: Knuckle Buster knuckle buster\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-stuffmissed-办一张商店信用卡-可能悄悄给你多开一个催收账户/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">25:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>辦一張商店信用卡，可能悄悄給你多開一個催收賬戶</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">有的大型百貨商店卡會在你不知情的情況下自動綁定一張Visa或Mastercard，月結餘額被悄悄轉到那張卡上，等你發現時賬單已經進了催收。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">花絮閒聊</span><span class=\"tag\">信用卡歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The climate crisis: What the data really say | Cooked? Ep 1 data centre moratoriums renewable energy certificates endangerment finding\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-naturepod-可再生能源涨得比所有人预测都快-这才是对抗气候变化真正的底牌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b1b06512ddf19b78-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">36:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>可再生能源漲得比所有人預測都快，這才是對抗氣候變化真正的底牌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">太陽能價格十年內跌到不到原來的六分之一，各國實際減排進度比預料的更快，但全球排放至今仍在逐年上升而非下降。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">氣候變化</span><span class=\"tag\">可再生能源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"E258 這個東西，我真的好想要！｜小酒館故事會🍻 高刷屏\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-zhixing-十年攒钱不舍得买车-直到妈妈确诊癌症才懂延迟满足有前提/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6630e1490acdc8b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">2:02:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒館</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>十年攢錢不捨得買車，直到媽媽確診癌症才懂延遲滿足有前提</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他十年前就攢夠了買特斯拉的錢，卻一次次轉投房產股票；直到母親確診胰腺癌、靶向藥只能延命8到9個月，他才想到延遲滿足得先活到滿足那天。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費觀</span><span class=\"tag\">延遲滿足</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Every Day Is Zero Day | Wiz CTO Ami Luttwak Blue Agent / Red Agent Atlas CSPM\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-a16z-黑色十月改变安全规则-ai-攻击全程只要-20-分钟/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>黑色十月改變安全規則：AI 攻擊全程只要 20 分鐘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Wiz CTO 說這是黑天鵝事件：開源模型追上了閉源模型的漏洞挖掘能力，攻擊者從拿到入口到偷走全部密鑰，整個過程只需約 20 分鐘。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI攻擊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"695. Can the U.S. Close Its Fertility Gap? fertility gap tempo effect instrumental variable strategy redlining\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-freakonomics-居家办公让美国多生了30万个孩子-比任何育儿补贴都有效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">56:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>居家辦公讓美國多生了30萬個孩子，比任何育兒補貼都有效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">政府發錢催生基本無效，但遠程辦公這個免費副產品讓美國生育率實打實上升——夫妻各自每週在家一天以上，生育意願就能從1.7衝到2.2。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生育率</span><span class=\"tag\">住房政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"516 從馬克·布洛赫入祀先賢祠看年鑑學派與當代法國社會文化思潮 Annales School Panthéon longue durée\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-cn2aa250-马克-布洛赫入祀先贤祠-历史学家如何被总统们轮流消费/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>馬克·布洛赫入祀先賢祠：歷史學家如何被總統們輪流消費</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">布洛赫生前反感學術權力、拒絕種族身份標籤，死後卻成了歷屆法國總統塑造「抵抗總統」人設的工具，他的家屬也因此分裂成贊成與反對兩派。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">年鑑學派</span><span class=\"tag\">法國史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vol.291｜雜吧地：天橋藝人和他們的江湖｜嘉賓：嶽永逸×孟慶延 雜巴地 撂地 海清 三不管\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-cn27f438-金庸写的是山林幻想-天桥艺人的江湖才是真实的中国社会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">東腔西調</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>金庸寫的是山林幻想，天橋藝人的江湖才是真實的中國社會</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">連闊如親歷的江湖，是國家行政力量管不到的地方、一個行業自發形成規矩、靠口碑而非頭銜維繫秩序的真實生活世界；金庸筆下那個門派林立的江湖，其實更接近陶淵明式的山林幻想。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民俗學</span><span class=\"tag\">江湖文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bedtime Battles: 5 Mistakes Making Sleep Harder From Toddlers to Teens\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-raisinggh-睡前谈判-开着电视-太兴奋-五个让孩子更难入睡的习惯/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f4ab6c930f328d5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">26:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>睡前談判、開著電視、太興奮：五個讓孩子更難入睡的習慣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子抗拒睡覺不是叛逆而是生理反應，真正拖垮睡眠的是父母自己製造的睡前刺激、順序混亂、屏幕、討價還價和環境問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童睡眠</span><span class=\"tag\">養育方式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"特番｜從做題家變成出題家，才能為硬技術找新用途\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-bizthisway-红外公司转型做质检设备时发现-自己只值10-的生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">42:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商業就是這樣</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>紅外公司轉型做質檢設備時發現：自己只值10%的生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">做紅外全身醫療篩查時，高德質感提供的技術只佔整個診斷服務價值的10%，剩下90%靠醫療認知和現場服務——於是他們放棄自己包辦，轉向只賣核心零部件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">紅外技術</span><span class=\"tag\">硬科技商業化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why a $2 Billion Law Firm Suddenly Collapsed eat what you kill lockstep compensation fraudulent transfer liability MSO (managed service organization) generational conflict\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-oddlots-合伙制律所能在零负债-利润仍增长时突然倒闭/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">58:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>合夥制律所能在零負債、利潤仍增長時突然倒閉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一家95年歷史的華爾街律所沒有鉅額負債，利潤也逐年上升，卻因增速跑輸同行，在幾個月內像銀行擠兌一樣瓦解，證明合夥制企業的致命傷是相對而非絕對錶現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">合夥制</span><span class=\"tag\">律所治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bravo, Comrade Lysenko! The Man who Failed to Feed the USSR vernalisation Lysenkoism Green Revolution\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-cautionary-苏联农学家靠一盆花拒绝做实验-饿死了同行也没喂饱苏联/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">43:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>蘇聯農學家靠一盆花拒絕做實驗，餓死了同行也沒餵飽蘇聯</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李森科說「飢餓不等人」拒絕田間試驗，靠花盆裡的一株麥子就宣布培育成功；博洛格同樣面對饑荒，卻用更多對照實驗餵飽了墨西哥。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科學方法</span><span class=\"tag\">蘇聯歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nvidia After Jensen Huang, What Huang Meant to the AI Ecosystem, Washington Gets Its Revenge Neoclouds Mellanox / MVLink N-2 rule MSS honeypot\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-sharptech-黄仁勋下台不是桃色事件-是华盛顿对英伟达积怨已久的总清算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳下臺不是桃色事件，是華盛頓對英偉達積怨已久的總清算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達對華出口政策上屢次頂撞國安系統，才是黃仁勳被趕下臺背後真正的導火索，緋聞只是壓垮他的最後一根稻草。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片禁令</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"187: 對話LiberAI劉松銘：Astra來襲，00後物理AI創始人看到的勝率 VLA WAM System 0/1/2 Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-latetalk-物理ai创始人提前押注硬件-基模一来-模型就会变薄/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/90e5508108d67243-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:09:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>物理AI創始人提前押注硬件：基模一來，模型就會變薄</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">劉松銘創業時就判斷GPT-6 Astra這類基模會吃掉具身智能的「System 2」部分，於是從第一天就把硬件和產品做成護城河，而不是先做一家純模型公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">物理AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI紅娘，3小時融資1500萬｜王欽文對話曾歆勳 EV1匹配 T度\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-wangqinwen-良配巴不得用户尽快离开-这恰恰是它的赚钱逻辑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">王</div><span class=\"dur\">59:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">王欽文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>良配巴不得用戶儘快離開，這恰恰是它的賺錢邏輯</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">良配賣的是不可續費會員，用戶配對成功就該走人——用戶走得越快，平臺要燒的token越少，這跟靠留存賺錢的多數AI產品正好相反。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI應用</span><span class=\"tag\">婚戀社交</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"156. 《俠》｜對影之刃零製作人梁其偉6小時訪談\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-zhangxiaojun-踩中风口在成功里只占1-99-是你是不是那块料/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/66aff61ecaa4b4d5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">6:27:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>踩中風口在成功裡只佔1%，99%是你是不是那塊料</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">梁其偉用自己多年做遊戲的教訓說：風口和資本敘事能撐起短期流水，但真正決定命運的，從來是創作者的心性而非外部環境。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">武俠文化</span><span class=\"tag\">遊戲行業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang Is Out at Nvidia Megaspeed entity list GTC TerraFab circular funding deals\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-hardfork-黄仁勋因间谍绯闻辞任英伟达ceo-公司内部找不到能接替他的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2c10adc5f3811ac6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">39:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Hard Fork</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳因間諜緋聞辭任英偉達CEO,公司內部找不到能接替他的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">繼任的CFO只能是過渡CEO,因為英偉達的掌舵人必須同時是頂尖計算機科學家、能對臺灣供應商發飆的強人，這種人目前只有黃仁勳一個。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">黃仁勳</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Indonesia’s Mega Rice Failure peatland Mega Rice Project Dayak\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-asianometry-苏哈托为挽救政治声誉-把婆罗洲泥炭地烧成了灾难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c10c2e5a1a2f5743-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">24:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>蘇哈托為挽救政治聲譽，把婆羅洲泥炭地燒成了災難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蘇哈托為延續「發展之父」聲譽強推百萬公頃稻田計劃，卻因泥炭地不適農耕、規劃缺失，最終釀成東南亞史上最大碳排放火災事件之一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">環境政策</span><span class=\"tag\">農業史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why an early Alzheimer’s theory is making a comeback, the U.S.’s electricity crisis, and improving precision medicine cholinergic hypothesis nucleus basalis of Meynert HVDC / VSC All of Us pharmacogenomics\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-sciencepod-阿尔茨海默病老牌假说被雪藏四十年-影像证据证明它可能是对的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b4ddc3718996fb27-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">50:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>阿爾茨海默病老牌假說被雪藏四十年，影像證據證明它可能是對的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一位年輕學者用影像數據證明，腦深部膽鹼能神經元的退化先於、而非跟隨皮層澱粉樣蛋白沉積，讓被澱粉樣蛋白假說擠下舞臺的老理論重新被認真對待。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿爾茨海默病</span><span class=\"tag\">澱粉樣蛋白假說</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is Anthropic on the cusp of RSI? Inside the redacted METR report | Luisa Rodriguez recursive self-improvement AI 2027\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-12-eightythousand-metr-发现-anthropic-用-ai-造-ai-速度已翻倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4a5c1f36515a82c4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">15:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>METR 發現 Anthropic 用 AI 造 AI，速度已翻倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">METR 調查認為，Anthropic 當前研發提速約八成來自用自家 AI 做研究，這正是外界警告多年的遞歸自我改進的雛形。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">遞歸自我改進</span>\n</div></div></a>"]